Scenario 13: Autoscaling Kafka Brokers
Interviewer

Can we put Kafka brokers behind HPA?

Model Answer

"Technically yes, but operationally it is much more complex than scaling stateless web applications.

Kafka brokers involve:

Plain Text
Persistent volumes
Partition assignment
Replication
Leader election
Rebalancing

Adding brokers does not instantly improve throughput.

For Kafka, infrastructure scaling requires careful capacity planning in addition to autoscaling."

